    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your perfect virtual girlfriend!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/3f6a0aee236b22a74a13d99f412982f6.poster.avif?t=1753865185\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/3f6a0aee236b22a74a13d99f412982f6.webm?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/3f6a0aee236b22a74a13d99f412982f6.mp4?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello. I'm your virtual girlfriend. I really want to spend time with you. You can change any of my parameters. I can be slim or fat, athletic or fragile. I can be any race, I can have any skin color, eyes, hair. I can even be a step on an alien. You can adjust the parameters of my breasts, hips, face. You can customize my facial features, hair color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/2da01b839238ccc84187cce4f6a60011.poster.avif?t=1753865185\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/2da01b839238ccc84187cce4f6a60011.webm?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/2da01b839238ccc84187cce4f6a60011.mp4?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can dress me up and undress me. I can be nacked. I can dance, do sports. You can feed me. But be careful, because I can get fat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/22d7ea8289bd482e89d9cb358f00acb9.poster.avif?t=1753865185\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/22d7ea8289bd482e89d9cb358f00acb9.webm?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/22d7ea8289bd482e89d9cb358f00acb9.mp4?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has several rooms where we can spend time together. You will be able to use a flexible camera system with adjustable zoom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/47cf9ca38af8a424d10efa64568e18c3.poster.avif?t=1753865185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/47cf9ca38af8a424d10efa64568e18c3.webm?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/47cf9ca38af8a424d10efa64568e18c3.mp4?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So hurry up, I can't wait to meet you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/64cfeff9aa2ef66ae9773cb80a302886.poster.avif?t=1753865185\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/64cfeff9aa2ef66ae9773cb80a302886.webm?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/64cfeff9aa2ef66ae9773cb80a302886.mp4?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/78074c2dfbee79494a100d59d5fbbf36.poster.avif?t=1753865185\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/78074c2dfbee79494a100d59d5fbbf36.webm?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710450/extras/78074c2dfbee79494a100d59d5fbbf36.mp4?t=1753865185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
